sequenceDiagram
  participant Admin
  participant PolicyAPI
  participant OpsApprover
  participant Lesson
  Admin->>PolicyAPI: Draft default provider and market rules
  PolicyAPI->>PolicyAPI: Credentials health capabilities and legal preflight
  PolicyAPI-->>Admin: Impact preview and dry-run
  Admin->>OpsApprover: Request second approval and MFA
  OpsApprover->>PolicyAPI: Approve effective-at version
  PolicyAPI->>Lesson: New unprovisioned lessons use new provider
  Lesson-->>Admin: Existing bound lessons unchanged
